Note: couple-flying-chess
========================================================================

https://github.com/woniu9524/couple-flying-chess

That repository states "MIT" in its README but ships no LICENSE file, so its
licensing status is not established. No code was copied from it. Material in
this project associated with it is limited to gameplay design and the subject
matter of 180 board-deck prompts, every one of which was rewritten in this
project's own words.

To remove its influence entirely, delete the `boardDecks` array and the
`sweet` / `love` / `burn` / `deep` / `merge` entries in `assets/data.js`.
See the "致谢" section of README.md for details.

